{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0034","paragraphs":[{"id":"p1d05803034ff-1","text":"曲阑干外天如水。"},{"id":"pf2a81e308beb-1","text":"昨夜还曾倚。"},{"id":"p94c6d274941b-1","text":"初将明月比佳期。"},{"id":"pcacea06c93dc-1","text":"长向月圆时候、望人归。"},{"id":"p71e4121423f5-1","text":"罗衣著破前香在。"},{"id":"p118751a8c0ce-1","text":"旧意谁教改。"},{"id":"p3e3c722e2c1e-1","text":"一春离恨懒调弦。"},{"id":"p1c2ae0c1db4c-1","text":"犹有两行闲泪、宝筝前。"}]}